e honour and is my gain.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.867,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-5-8"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4005011","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"401368a0f8b4ddceb5a4fbf73e851731c7860d3b1bfd87cf45a21cb4fc217c80","compact":"b1ece17833f0ad1125e03378e0a225e1a4e2429899230b3353d4f8dafee10083","nasal":"b1ece17833f0ad1125e03378e0a225e1a4e2429899230b3353d4f8dafee10083"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-5-12","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":5,"verse":12,"english":"If you relish friendship with me, do you take this stretched arm and my hand with yours, and bind yourself fast with a vow.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.734,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-5-9"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4005012","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"984cffa9278221b9f6bd32ff77f2816a34c2438df00f3f0d0654dcf5930161af","compact":"ef2303776b926244f572e8a6a662511122fde09d684a06628b45d8beb9d6a892","nasal":"ef2303776b926244f572e8a6a662511122fde09d684a06628b45d8beb9d6a892"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-5-13","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":5,"verse":13,"english":"Hearing these sweet words of Sugrīva, (Rāma) exceedingly delighted, pressed Sugrīva's hand with his. And contracting friendship with Surgrīva, Rāma experiencing great joy embraced him warmly.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.804,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-5-10"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4005013","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"00b288ee99a3699015f584463d5aa169a5ae2416e30a135e567c0fa97f73c32f","compact":"af8ead7ef7315f2ad16e61f49aa9434ccbb5c71380946c588950b95977bb4dbc","nasal":"16155ba578c32ae53bb4fd4b558c852ca6bd55801053494c80b56463f46b6651"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-5-14","kanda":4,